{
  "sequence_id": "seq_41d68dfc426cc19e",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I made some okayu with potatoes today."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "There's a whole lot!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Hmph."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Oh, working hard there, OTSU? Be careful ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Otsu's all happy because she can be with Master more since he can't fight."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "health- transformation"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Not hungry."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Huh!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If--"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "If you don't eat ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Not hungry right now."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Musashi."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Will you not eat?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "It was delicious."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "A bit salty though..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I'll... have some later."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I don't want any right now."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "here."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "AH. Later"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T9",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "There we go."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T10",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Are you in pain?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T11",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "A single stroke of the sword with everything he had from behind..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T12",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Even the Yoshioka couldn't care about how they look to others."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T13",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Stay here a while and recuperate."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "OTSU will stay here by your side."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Eh."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Oh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Listen, Musashi."
    }
  ],
